const description = 'Ihr Experte für DevSecOps, FinOps, AIOps & AI-Engineering-Coaching (>1.000% / 10x Produktivität): Sichere CI/CD-Pipelines, Kubernetes, Terraform, GitOps, AI Reviews & Skill-Automationen.';
